<title>USA: Stone Street Bancorp Q1 $0.29 per share.</title>
<headline>Stone Street Bancorp Q1 $0.29 per share.</headline>
<dateline>MOCKSVILLE, N.C. 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stone Street Bancorp Inc</p>
<p>					Three Months Ended March 31</p>
<p>						1997		1996</p>
<p> Net Earnings			 $525,991	  $203,954</p>
<p> Earnings per share		     0.29		 N/A</p>
<p> Shares outstanding		1,825,050		 N/A</p>
<p>Total assets at the end of the quarter equaled $105.5 million compared to $116.1 million at March 31, 1996.</p>
<p>Deposits decreased from $66.6 million on Dec. 31, 1996 to $66.3 million on March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>Stockholder's equity totaled $37,805,802 at March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>In March the company paid its fourth quarter regular cash dividend. The dividend amounted to $.1125 per share totaling $205,318.</p>
</text>
